    <!-- Screen -->
    <string name="flowlines_help_title">How to Play Flow Lines</string>
    <string name="flowlines_help_text">Join each pair of matching dots with a path. Drag from a dot to draw; the path follows your finger one square at a time.\n\nPaths can never cross. Drawing over another path cuts it, and you cannot run through a dot of another colour. Drag back along your path to retrace it, or drag onto an earlier square to shorten it.\n\nThe puzzle is solved when every pair is joined and every square is covered. Every puzzle can be solved.\n\nEach dot and path carries a letter or a shape as well as a colour. Your clock starts on your first stroke, and your best moves and best time are saved for each size. A hint shows part of a correct path, and a puzzle solved with a hint sets no record. The daily puzzle is the same for every player at the same size.</string>
    <string name="flowlines_leave_title">Leave this puzzle?</string>
    <string name="flowlines_leave_body">This puzzle is still unsolved. Leaving now won\'t count it as a win or a loss.</string>
    <string name="flowlines_leave_body_keeps">This puzzle is still unsolved and won\'t count, but the puzzles you\'ve already solved stay on your record.</string>
